# Universal Agent Harness — ephemeral runtime state (regenerated by the CLIs).
# Restored 2026-08-05: the root .gitignore was untracked during the public-tree
# cleanup, leaving notify_config.json (which can hold a bot token) trackable and
# several runtime artifacts noisy in `git status`.

# Secrets — a Telegram/webhook bot token lives here once notify.py is configured.
.harness/notify_config.json

# Locks and the guard file (per-session, TTL-bounded).
.harness/locks/*.lock
.harness/locks/.guard

# Observability logs and per-run state.
.harness/logs/*.jsonl
.harness/logs/goal_mode_state.json
.harness/logs/goal_mode_last_failure.md

# Session identity registry (per-machine).
.harness/session_holders.json

# AST index cache.
.harness/index/

# Reversible-deletion quarantine, and the archives `blackboard.py reset` writes.
.harness/trash/

# Python / OS noise.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# Identity gate (warrant.py / attest.py): public material is tracked, private keys never.
# The mechanical guard is test_warrant.py::NoPrivateKeyIsEverTracked, which scans every
# tracked file. These patterns only reduce the chance of reaching that test in anger.
.harness/keys/
*_key
id_ed25519
id_rsa
!*.pub

# Sidecar event log from a MIS-ROOTED invocation, never from normal use.
# precedent.py writes <root>/events.jsonl whenever --root is not the live precedents
# directory. Tests use throwaway roots, so their sidecars die with them. This path can
# only appear when someone points --root at `.harness` itself, which is a typo -- the
# real log is .harness/logs/events.jsonl. Ignored so a typo cannot quietly enter git.
.harness/events.jsonl

# Operator-local material that stays on the operator's disk and is never published.
# README.md, ORCHESTRATION.md and the precedent registry already name these as
# operator-local; a fresh clone does not contain them.
harness-optimization-reference/
coffee-bench-reference/
agentic-harness-engineering-reference/
gemini-prompts/
fetched_docs/
docs/
COMO-LO-USO-YO.md
GEMINI_DEEPMIND_INTEGRATION_RESEARCH.md
universal_harness_architecture.jpg
.harness/logs/bench_sync_recommendation.md
.harness/logs/audit_t303_protected_paths.md
